{"pin":"BH00083","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00083","anchor":"","first_line":"Sanctified praise beseemeth the most holy court of the nearness of the Eternal, the Beloved One, Who was and is and ever shall be [3.5s]... ...Say: no man can attain his true station except through his justice. No power can exist except through unity. No welfare and no well-being can be attained except through consultation… In all things it is necessary to consult","first_line_orig":"حمد مقدس از لم یزل و لایزال ساحت قرب قدس حضرت محبوب بیزوالی را لایق و سزاست  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"4800","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA27:293","source":"INBA27","locator":"293","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba-v027/?page=147"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#086","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"086","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/675879623"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS4.213ax","source":"MAS4","locator":"213ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS4/mas4-213.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS8.059bx","source":"MAS8","locator":"059bx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS8/mas8-59.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PYK.093","source":"PYK","locator":"093","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/1484.pdf#page=110"},{"kind":"publication","code":"UAB.051ax","source":"UAB","locator":"051ax","url":"http://www.loomofreality.org/sources/UAB.pdf#page=28"},{"kind":"publication","code":"YMM.310x","source":"YMM","locator":"310x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/326.pdf#page=318"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_ATBH#28x","source":"BRL_ATBH","locator":"28x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/632401213"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CONSULT#02x","source":"BRL_CONSULT","locator":"02x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/690813523"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CONSULT#05x","source":"BRL_CONSULT","locator":"05x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/737437268"},{"kind":"tra